  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1383",
      "html": "<p>Hyalobagrus ornatus (Duncker, 1904), the Ornate Shadow Catfish. Type locality: Muar River at Tubing Tinggi, Malaysia. Size: 3 cm SL.</p><p>IUCN Red List category: Critically Endangered (last assessed 2018).</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1383",
      "html": "<p>Asia: Muar drainage in southern Malay Peninsula, Malaysia and Kapuas basin in western Borneo, Indonesia.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1383",
      "html": "<ul><li>pH: 5.0–6.2</li><li>Temperature: 22–27°C</li><li>Little or no current preferred.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "equipment",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1383",
      "html": "<p>They do best with plenty of shade (in the form of vegetation), so a heavily planted tank is the ideal setup for these fish.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1383",
      "html": "<p>Readily feeds on live/frozen foods and smaller-sized prepared foods such as micropellets, but shows a preference for the former.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1383",
      "html": "<p>A peaceful, diurnal shoaling species that should be kept in groups of four or more individuals.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "dimorphism",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1383",
      "html": "<p>Males have an elongate genital papilla.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "reproduction",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1383",
      "html": "<p>Not reported. There is no breeding report.</p>"
    },
